mindmap
  root((Polymorphism))
    Compile-Time
      Function Overloading
      Template Instantiation
      Zero runtime overhead
      Types known at compile time
    Runtime
      Virtual Functions
        vtable / vptr mechanism
        Dynamic dispatch
        Indirect call overhead
      Virtual Destructors
        Proper cleanup in hierarchies
        Rule: virtual if any virtual function
      Abstract Classes
        Pure virtual functions = 0
        Cannot instantiate
        Define interfaces
      RTTI
        dynamic_cast
        typeid
        Use sparingly
    Comparison
      Compile-Time: Faster, rigid
      Runtime: Flexible, slower
      Choose based on problem
